DE:
Heute hab ich echt viel Besuch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Und alle wollen mir Angst einjagen!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Kommt ruhig alle her!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin trainiert und bereit!

TRANSLATION:
Demek evdeysen gelip seni
korkutuyorlarmış.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}
Gelsinler!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hazırım!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Non mais sérieux, c'est quoi cette
fête ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} T'as le choix entre faire peur
aux gens, ou leur jouer des tours.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Crees que estás preparad{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
para Halloween?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Pues asústame
si puedes!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bist du ein {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Halloween{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}-Champ?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Zeig mir, was du draufhast!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Versuch, mich zu erschrecken!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Cadılar Bayramı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yeteneğine
güveniyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Hadi beni korkut!

{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Beni korkutmaya gelen kafasına
şaplağı yer.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Ama gerçekten çok korkunç biri
gelirse{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}şeker{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ile savuştururum artık.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Stay on guard all day today,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Some folks are for sure
gonna try to trick you!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}But it's a whole different ballgame
if you've got {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}candy {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}on you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Reste bien sur tes gardes,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}} ! C'est couru d'avance
qu'on va vouloir te faire des farces !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Par contre,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} si t'as des {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}friandises {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}sur
toi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} c'est une autre histoire !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I'm not afraid of ghosts!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}They're all wispy, and they have,
like, zero muscle! No way they can
get the best of me!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}J'ai pas peur des fantômes !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ils pèsent trois fois rien et sont à
peine capables de soulever un drap !
Qu'est-ce que j'ai à craindre ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Io non ho paura dei fantasmi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Sono tutti magrolini! Non hanno
uno straccio di muscoli! Non esiste
proprio che possano battermi!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hayaletten korkmam!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Duman gibiler, kas sıfır! Beni
nasıl yenecekler?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Canavar bana rakip bile olamaz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Yüzü korkunç, iri yarı ama
yavaş!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Biri gelse yarışa çağırırım!
Kaybeden evine! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
Werwölfe sind stark und schnell!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Irgendwie sind sie Monsterversionen
von mir{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wenn einer von ihnen hier auftaucht,
gibt das bestimmt ein Weltklasse-
Armdrück-Duell!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, gli scheletri non mi spaventano
nemmeno un po'!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Pensaci! Come farebbero dei tizi
senza muscoli a farmi paura?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Skelette?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Die find ich fast niedlich!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Denk doch mal nach! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Wie soll ich
jemanden ernst nehmen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}der nicht
mal Muskeln hat?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evet, iskelet beni zerre
korkutmaz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Düşünsene! Bir gram kası
olmayan şey
BENİ nasıl yenecek?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Hé ! Je t'ai filé une friandise !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Alors sois une bonne citrouille et
va voir dans ton potager si j'y suis !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Haha! O kostüm beni hiç
korkutmadı!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}
Beni ürkütmeye çalıştığın için
sana şaka yapmalıyım.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Ama kurtulma şansı veriyorum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Oyun oynayacağız. Sen
kazanırsan {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}şeker{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} veririm!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Ben kazanırsam seni fena
şakalarım! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}How d'ya like me now? You made a
big mistake trying to get the best of
me, you know! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¿Y ahora qué te parezco?
¡Pensarías que ibas a poder
conmigo y todo, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}On fait moins le malin, hein ? T'as
fait une grosse erreur en
t'attaquant à moi ! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ah ah ah! E ora, come la mettiamo?
Pensavi di essere più in gamba di
me, ma ti sbagliavi! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Rache ist Blutwurst!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Du darfst nie den Fehler machen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
mich zu unterschätzen!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Du hast bekommen,
was du wolltest.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und jetzt verschwinde endlich!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}De todas las cosas que he visto
que pretendían asustarme{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡esa, esa ha sido la más horrible!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Von allen Monstern, die mich heute
heimgesucht haben{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
warst du das Schlimmste!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I'll give you {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}candy{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}! Just go away!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Wait! You don't have any room in
your pockets!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}You know, {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0012:0004:00CD}}
with its hands full really isn't all
that scary after all{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Heya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Happy Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Candy, please!
Let's chat!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡Epa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Feliz Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Chuches, por favor!
¡Hablemos!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Yo !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Joyeux Halloween !{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Une friandise ou la vie !
Quoi de neuf ?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Ciao!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Buon Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Voglio dei dolcetti!
Parliamo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey ho!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fröhliches {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Halloween{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Gib mir Süßes!
Lass uns reden!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mutlu Cadılar Bayramı!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Şeker lütfen!
Sohbet edelim!

EN:
Yo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Happy Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
I want some candy!
Let's talk!

ES:
¡Hola, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! ¡Feliz Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Quiero chuches!
¡Hablemos!

FR:
Yo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ! Joyeux Halloween !{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
File-moi une sucrerie !
Ça roule ?

IT:
Ciao, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Buon Halloween!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Hai dei dolcetti?
Parliamo un po'!

TRANSLATION:
Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Mutlu Cadılar Bayramı!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Biraz şeker istiyorum!
Konuşalım!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Das funktioniert nicht mit mir!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Klar siehst du schrecklich aus,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
aber eben nicht schrecklich genug!
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Um mir Angst einzujagen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}musst du
schon 'ne superschreckliche Maske
tragen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0006:1800530070006F0072007400730066007200650075006E0064001C00530070006F0072007400730066007200650075006E00640069006E00}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Vamos allá! {{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Que el {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}juego de los
gestos{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} decida lo que tenga
que pasar!{{TAG:0007:0012:010136003700}}

IT:
Hai proprio una fortuna sfacciata!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ma la prossima volta vincerò io,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
